# Migrated diagnostic packets under `docs/diagnostics/` are byte-identical
# copies of monorepo source. Trailing whitespace inside their fenced
# ```diff blocks is intentional — those spaces are unified-diff
# context-line markers for blank lines in the captured source diffs
# (removing them would corrupt the captured diff). See the §Diagnostics
# subsection of `docs/migration/monorepo-extraction-manifest.md` for
# the migration policy and the active-classification rationale.
docs/diagnostics/*.md  whitespace=-blank-at-eol
